William Brodersen User Stories:
1. As a user, I want to log in using my login name, so that I can access the app
- Valid login_name logs user in
- Session is created
- Redirects to user detail view
2. As a user, I want to see my comment immedialetly after posting
- UI updates without page reload
- Comment includes text, user, and timestamp
3. As a user, I want my uploaded photo to appear immediately, so that I know it worked
-Photo shows in user's photo list
-Includes correct metadata (data, user)
4. As a user, I want my password to be hidden while typing, so that my information is private
- Password fields use masked input
- No plain text visible
